{"id":"3e81f7271adc21df","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-shannon-circuit-lower-bound.md","title":"Shannon Counting Bound","display":"thm-shannon-circuit-lower-bound — Shannon Counting Bound","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-shannon-circuit-lower-bound","aliases":["28-thm-shannon-circuit-lower-bound","Shannon Circuit Lower Bound"],"display":"thm-shannon-circuit-lower-bound — Shannon Counting Bound","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","[[28-df-circuit-size]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 6.21 and following probabilistic-method argument","source_printed_pages":"115–116","source_pdf_pages":"141–142","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-shannon-circuit-lower-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-shannon-circuit-lower-bound</span><span>Shannon Circuit Lower Bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-shannon-circuit-lower-bound — Shannon Counting Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 6.21 and following probabilistic-method argument"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"115–116"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"141–142"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_n=\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal F_n=\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal F_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal F_n\\)</span>；有界扇入谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}\">\\(\\operatorname{size}\\)</span> 为非输入门数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CS}_2(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\operatorname{size}(C):C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\ \\operatorname{BF}(C),\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle f(x)\\rangle\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CS}_2(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\operatorname{size}(C):C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\ \\operatorname{BF}(C),\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle f(x)\\rangle\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{|\\{f\\in\\mathcal F_n:\\operatorname{CS}_2(f)\\ge2^n/(10n)\\}|}{2^{2^n}}=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{|\\{f\\in\\mathcal F_n:\\operatorname{CS}_2(f)\\ge2^n/(10n)\\}|}{2^{2^n}}=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>为核对非输入门计费下的具体常数，先把输入按其固定次序编号，余下门按拓扑序编号。对至多 s 个门的电路，每个门至多有五种标签（0、1、NOT、AND、OR），并可用两个带空位的前驱槽描述，槽值至多 n+s+1 种。连同输出顶点选择及门数，所计算的函数总数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s+1)(n+s)[5(n+s+1)^2]^s\">\\((s+1)(n+s)[5(n+s+1)^2]^s\\)</span>；这只是描述上界，冗余或非法描述只会多计。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=\\lfloor2^n/(10n)\\rfloor\">\\(s=\\lfloor2^n/(10n)\\rfloor\\)</span>，该上界的二底对数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1/5+o(1))2^n\">\\((1/5+o(1))2^n\\)</span>，除以全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{2^n}\">\\(2^{2^n}\\)</span> 个函数后趋零。因此大小小于阈值的函数比例趋零，得到断言。任意有限电路可作这样的拓扑重编号，不影响其函数。书中计全部顶点；以上计数直接使用本地非输入门约定并允许常量及零/一扇入门，消除了仅凭未定 O 常数保留 10 的证明缺口。不能把此前驱槽计数套在无界扇入电路上。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Theorem 6.21 and following probabilistic-method argument，印刷页 115–116；PDF 页 141–142。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次还复核了对应证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\mathcal F_n=\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}$，$f\\in\\mathcal F_n$；有界扇入谓词见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{size}$ 为非输入门数，见 [[28-df-circuit-size]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_n=\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathcal F_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CS}_2(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\operatorname{size}(C):C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\ \\operatorname{BF}(C),\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ \\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle f(x)\\rangle\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{|\\{f\\in\\mathcal F_n:\\operatorname{CS}_2(f)\\ge2^n/(10n)\\}|}{2^{2^n}}=1.","display":true},{"tex":"(s+1)(n+s)[5(n+s+1)^2]^s","display":false},{"tex":"s=\\lfloor2^n/(10n)\\rfloor","display":false},{"tex":"(1/5+o(1))2^n","display":false},{"tex":"2^{2^n}","display":false}],"bytes":2384,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"下界工具：[[28-thm-shannon-circuit-lower-bound]]、[[28-df-switching-restriction]]、[[28-thm-parity-not-in-ac0]]。"}],"outgoing":["7776a98a623ada8d","14f69cc09dc02600"]}